  "content": "<p>🛋️ <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>廢棄城市建築</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;</span>- <span style=\"color:#34495e\">末日裝飾擴充套件</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>英:</strong></span></p>\n<p>此擴充套件為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">廢棄末日建築</a>的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doomsday Decoration</a>添加<b>裝飾道具</b>。<br>您的毀壞的建築物將感覺更加身臨其境——包含<strong>屍體和血跡</strong>。</p>\n<p>基於<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Berezka API</strong></span>開發，因此需要以下模組正常工作：</p>\n<p>🛠️ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>必裝模組:</strong></span></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">廢棄末日建築</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-city-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berekza API for Abandoned City Buildings</a></p>\n<p>🔗&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka 庫</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doomsday Decoration</a></p>\n<p>💬 加入我們的<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Discord</span>以獲取最新消息和建議：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">俄:</span></p>\n<p>此模組為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doomsday Decoration</a>中的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">廢棄末日建築結構</a>添加<b>裝飾道具</b>。<br>現在廢棄建築的氛圍更加濃厚——內部包含<strong>屍體和血跡</strong>。</p>\n<p>此模組基於<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Berezka API</strong></span>開發，所以需要其他模組配合使用。</p>\n<p>🛠️ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>必裝模組:</strong></span></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">廢棄末日建築</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-city-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka API for Abandoned City Buildings</a></p>\n<p>🔗&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka 庫</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Doomsday Decoration</a></p>\n<p>💬 加入我們的<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Discord</span>或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram 頻道</span>，以便接收更新、反饋並提供建議：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>",
